{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44245922",
      "title": "Registering Multiple Form Actions",
      "sourceHash": "82069fb8a8538a78d5c868e7dea61fb064a0e4e70136c3cff54f374487eddc02",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 4.2,
          "en": "Now in this application here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.2,
          "end": 5.76,
          "en": "the form here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.76,
          "end": 10.76,
          "en": "in the new-opinion component is not the only place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.37,
          "end": 14.553,
          "en": "in this application where data should be submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.08,
          "end": 19.53,
          "en": "Instead, we also have these vote buttons here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.53,
          "end": 21.93,
          "en": "which at the moment don't do anything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.93,
          "end": 25.26,
          "en": "except for resetting this page somehow,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.26,
          "end": 27.6,
          "en": "but they don't do anything else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.6,
          "end": 28.83,
          "en": "And it would of course be nice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.83,
          "end": 33.83,
          "en": "if clicking these buttons would change this vote count here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.87,
          "end": 37.563,
          "en": "so that users can vote opinions up or down.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.91,
          "end": 41.823,
          "en": "Now for that, we can go to the Opinion component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 42.87,
          "end": 44.55,
          "en": "which is the component responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.55,
          "end": 46.95,
          "en": "for outputting a single opinion here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.95,
          "end": 50.31,
          "en": "because it's in there where these buttons can be found.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.31,
          "end": 51.363,
          "en": "Here they are.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.35,
          "end": 56.733,
          "en": "And as you see, they are also inside of a form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.99,
          "end": 61.38,
          "en": "but now it's two buttons in one form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.38,
          "end": 63.09,
          "en": "And when we click the buttons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.09,
          "end": 65.82,
          "en": "we actually want to do different things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.82,
          "end": 69.18,
          "en": "So it may be the same form that is being submitted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.18,
          "end": 72.03,
          "en": "but we want to send different kinds of requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.03,
          "end": 73.56,
          "en": "upon that form submission,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.56,
          "end": 75.963,
          "en": "depending on which button was used.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.98,
          "end": 81.98,
          "en": "So in the end, I kind of want to have two form actions here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.2,
          "end": 84.48,
          "en": "one for each button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.48,
          "end": 87.45,
          "en": "because in this application, in my context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.45,
          "end": 89.82,
          "en": "I do have separate functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.82,
          "end": 92.10300000000001,
          "en": "for upvoting and downvoting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.94,
          "end": 97.53,
          "en": "And at the moment in there, I am only updating the state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.53,
          "end": 101.78999999999999,
          "en": "Soon, we will also send a request to the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.78999999999999,
          "end": 104.43,
          "en": "But let's start with the main problem here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.43,
          "end": 107.82,
          "en": "The fact that I want to trigger different form actions here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.82,
          "end": 109.53,
          "en": "for the two different buttons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.53,
          "end": 111.723,
          "en": "even though I only have one form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.62,
          "end": 114.69,
          "en": "Well, the great thing is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.69,
          "end": 119.16,
          "en": "that form action functions can actually not just be set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.16,
          "end": 122.73,
          "en": "as values for the action prompt of the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.73,
          "end": 126.99,
          "en": "but instead you can also go to buttons inside of a form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 126.99,
          "end": 130.65,
          "en": "and add the formAction prompt to such a button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.65,
          "end": 134.25,
          "en": "and set that to a action function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.25,
          "end": 137.7,
          "en": "That's also something that's allowed by React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.7,
          "end": 140.04,
          "en": "And that then of course allows you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 140.04,
          "end": 144.153,
          "en": "to trigger different form actions for different buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.413,
          "end": 150.06,
          "en": "So therefore, here in this application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 150.06,
          "end": 153.09,
          "en": "I'll add a new form action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 153.09,
          "end": 156.45,
          "en": "again, inside of this component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 156.45,
          "end": 159.12,
          "en": "since I'll need to work with some data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 159.12,
          "end": 161.133,
          "en": "that's only available in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 162.18,
          "end": 164.04,
          "en": "And I'll add a first function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 164.04,
          "end": 166.113,
          "en": "which I'll name upvoteAction,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 168.96,
          "end": 172.62,
          "en": "for example, and then also add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 172.62,
          "end": 174.813,
          "en": "a second function called downvoteAction.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 177.42000000000002,
          "end": 181.44,
          "en": "Now here, we could still accept the formData,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 181.44,
          "end": 183.153,
          "en": "we would still get that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 184.65,
          "end": 188.613,
          "en": "But in my case here, my form actually has no inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 189.45,
          "end": 191.43,
          "en": "So I don't care about the formData.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 191.43,
          "end": 194.973,
          "en": "Instead, I just want these functions to be triggered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 195.84,
          "end": 198.63,
          "en": "So therefore, upvoteAction is now set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 198.63,
          "end": 200.82,
          "en": "as a value for this first button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 200.82,
          "end": 203.193,
          "en": "for its formAction prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 204.45,
          "end": 206.13,
          "en": "And then for the second button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 206.13,
          "end": 208.96,
          "en": "which is responsible for downvoting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 210.48,
          "end": 211.86,
          "en": "for this button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 211.86,
          "end": 214.983,
          "en": "I'll set formAction to downvoteAction.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 217.727,
          "end": 219.3,
          "en": "So with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 219.3,
          "end": 222.15,
          "en": "these two different action functions are being triggered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 222.15,
          "end": 226.23,
          "en": "And for example here, we could console.log('UPVOTE')",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 226.23,
          "end": 227.91,
          "en": "to see whether that works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 227.91,
          "end": 230.37,
          "en": "And in the second action function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 230.37,
          "end": 231.82,
          "en": "I'll console.log('DOWNVOTE').",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 234.18,
          "end": 237.9,
          "en": "With that done, if you save this and if you reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 237.9,
          "end": 239.82,
          "en": "if you open your developer tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 239.82,
          "end": 243.51,
          "en": "and you open the JavaScript console there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 243.51,
          "end": 246.99,
          "en": "if you click the upvote button, you see upvote being logged,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 246.99,
          "end": 248.82,
          "en": "and hopefully unsurprisingly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 248.82,
          "end": 251.133,
          "en": "for the downvote button, it's downvote.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 252.06,
          "end": 253.65,
          "en": "So that works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 253.65,
          "end": 257.61,
          "en": "and that's how you can register multiple form actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 257.61,
          "end": 262.61,
          "en": "for one single form if you have multiple buttons in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 262.68,
          "end": 264,
          "en": "Now as a next step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 264,
          "end": 265.5,
          "en": "I of course want to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 265.5,
          "end": 268.29,
          "en": "that we actually send a request to the backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 268.29,
          "end": 270.633,
          "en": "when those actions are being triggered.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}